Chapter: BvtManaPulse
  cites Uoaix chapter MageryTick
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 A mana point is due at tick 100 for an actor of INT 50 holding 10: 1 its own pulse takes it, 2 another session's pulse
 does not (a player's point waits for its own pulse, so the update reaches its client), 4 a pulse before it is due does
 not, 8 a full pool does not; 15 is all.
  bmp-checks : Integer -> Integer
  bmp-checks (unused) = let actor = list-at (mgs-actors 1 []) 0
    in let a = __record-set actor "intelligence" 50
    in let b = __record-set actor "mana" 10
    in let c = __record-set actor "regen" 100
    in let own = mgt-regen-now actor 100 False
    in let other = not (mgt-regen-now actor 100 True)
    in let early = not (mgt-regen-now actor 99 False)
    in let filled = __record-set actor "mana" 50
    in let full = not (mgt-regen-now actor 100 False)
    in (if own then 1 else 0) + (if other then 2 else 0) + (if early then 4 else 0) + (if full then 8 else 0)
  bvt-mana-pulse : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-mana-pulse (unused) = act
    n <- bmp-checks 0
    bvt-check ("a player's mana point is taken in its own pulse only, when due and below full (code " & show n & ")") (n == 15)
  end
